WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,170 --> 00:00:02,070
Young Master

2
00:00:02,370 --> 00:00:03,810
I don’t want to beat around the bush anymore.

3
00:00:04,210 --> 00:00:07,760
May I ask if the master has any family members who have had it before?

4
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:09,620
There may not be any now

5
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:11,840
I don’t know, Mr.

6
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:13,920
Do you have any idea of joining Yifang family?

7
00:00:16,020 --> 00:00:17,220
What does iron girl mean?

8
00:00:18,050 --> 00:00:20,170
I want to invite the young master into my household

9
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:23,620
You want me to be your guest

10
00:00:25,830 --> 00:00:27,750
If the young master would like to be my guest

11
00:00:28,310 --> 00:00:30,870
Sanniang must thank you very much

12
00:00:31,510 --> 00:00:32,630
I don’t know what I mean by thanking you very much

13
00:00:33,030 --> 00:00:35,190
I saw the young master and You'er having a happy conversation

14
00:00:35,430 --> 00:00:37,430
I can betroth You'er to the young master

15
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:40,800
Iron Girl must have misunderstood

16
00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:43,280
You'er girl is very similar to my former sister

17
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:45,120
So it is inevitable that we will feel close to each other

18
00:00:45,120 --> 00:00:46,120
What does that young man want?

19
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:47,880
On weekdays, I negotiate with the Tie family no matter how big the business is.

20
00:00:47,880 --> 00:00:48,960
I've never been so anxious

21
00:00:49,080 --> 00:00:50,080
And the reason why

22
00:00:50,360 --> 00:00:52,640
It's because I have had a special ability since I was a child

23
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:55,080
I can feel whether something is good or bad for me

24
00:00:55,160 --> 00:00:56,480
That is to say, relying on this ability

25
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:57,920
Plus my smart brain

26
00:00:58,040 --> 00:01:00,280
So you can be like a fish in water in the business world
